# Scott tuple, whose names the host keeps in
# gezi.standardlibrary.TermTables.programFamilyLibraryTerms, read by projection
# (StandardLibrary.entryMembers). Only the program families read these terms;
# no framework code reads them.
# FIXME: the imports project "corpora" off the variable gezi, the name https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/1924
# of the project root's own directory; they break if that directory is renamed.
